.el .ds Aq '
.TH search 1  "search " 
.SH NAME
search \- Search catalog content, packages, and editorial channels
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsearch\fR [\fB\-\-kind\fR] [\fB\-\-channel\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIQUERY\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search catalog content, packages, and editorial channels
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-kind\fR \fI<KIND>\fR [default: all]
Which backend to search: all, catalog, package, or channel
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
all: Search the local catalog index (FTS) and, when requested, editorial channels and gossip
.IP \(bu 2
catalog: Search only the local catalog index (FTS over subscribed catalog docs)
.IP \(bu 2
package: Search installed packages and, when requested, the gossip package catalog
.IP \(bu 2
channel: Search only an editorial channel
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-channel\fR \fI<CHANNEL>\fR
Restrict results to an editorial channel
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<LIMIT>\fR [default: 20]
Maximum number of results
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
[\fIQUERY\fR]
Search query; omit to list everything
